WEBVTT
NOTE OpenIE Planetary 15s v1.0 — interface-economics (yo) · elevenlabs:eleven_v4_turbo

1
00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:09.265
<v Narrator>Ni akọkọ, awọn aṣiṣe ti o pọju kan ni awọn aami idiyele to tọ, bii pipadanu iṣẹ Mars lori awọn ẹya ti ko ni ibamu.

2
00:00:09.345 --> 00:00:21.483
<v Narrator>Ninu awọn ọrọ miiran, awọn nọmba ti o tobi julọ ti awọn aṣiṣe sọfitiwia orilẹ-ede wa lati awọn iwadi ati awọn awoṣe nla, kii ṣe ni lilo awọn aṣẹ nikan.

3
00:00:21.563 --> 00:00:27.390
<v Narrator>Oju-iwe ayelujara kan le jẹ ohun gbogbo, ṣugbọn o ni lati wa ni igbẹkẹle.
